INSERT INTO `Watch` VALUES ('ap-01','audemars-piguet-royal-oak-15500st','audemars-piguet','Royal Oak Selfwinding','15500ST.OO.1220ST.01',NULL,38500,2020,'Sport','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,1,93,'2025-09-18 00:00:00','The 15500ST is the Royal Oak at its purest: 41mm of brushed steel, the octagonal bezel with its eight white-gold screws, and the slate-grey Grande Tapisserie dial.\n\nSharp, unpolished and complete with its 2020 warranty — the integrated-bracelet icon in its definitive modern form.','{\"caliber\": \"AP 4302\", \"bracelet\": \"Integrated steel bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Grey Grande Tapisserie\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"41mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"waterResistance\": \"50m\"}',1,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,1,NULL,'NV-AUD-15500ST.OO.1220ST.01','2026-10-11 01:30:15'),('ap-02','audemars-piguet-royal-oak-offshore-26470st','audemars-piguet','Royal Oak Offshore Chronograph','26470ST.OO.A101CR.01',NULL,29800,2018,'Chronograph','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,80,'2025-04-08 00:00:00','The Offshore took Genta\'s design and turned the volume up — 42mm, ceramic pushers, and a Méga Tapisserie dial built for the wrist of a racing driver.\n\nThis 2018 \"Safari\" variant pairs the ivory dial with a brown hornback alligator strap.','{\"caliber\": \"AP 3126/3840\", \"bracelet\": \"Hornback alligator strap\", \"dialColor\": \"Ivory\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, small seconds, date, chronograph\", \"caseDiameter\": \"42mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"50 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',1,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-AUD-26470ST.OO.A101CR.01','2026-10-11 01:30:18'),('ap-03','audemars-piguet-royal-oak-jumbo-15202st','audemars-piguet','Royal Oak \"Jumbo\" Extra-Thin','15202ST.OO.1240ST.01',NULL,68500,2017,'Dress','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,91,'2025-10-30 00:00:00','The watch Genta drew in one night, rendered 8.1mm thin. The 15202\'s Petite Tapisserie blue dial and hand-finished calibre 2121 make it the connoisseur\'s Royal Oak.\n\nArriving shortly — register your interest with our concierge team.','{\"caliber\": \"AP 2121\", \"bracelet\": \"Integrated steel bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Blue Petite Tapisserie\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"39mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"40 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"50m\"}',1,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,1,NULL,'NV-AUD-15202ST.OO.1240ST.01','2026-10-11 01:30:19'),('ap-04','audemars-piguet-code-1159-15210bc','audemars-piguet','Code 11.59 Selfwinding','15210BC.OO.A068CR.01',NULL,26500,2022,'Dress','White gold','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,55,'2025-03-19 00:00:00','Code 11.59 is AP\'s architectural counterpoint to the Royal Oak — a round white-gold case hiding an octagonal middle, under a double-curved sapphire.\n\nThis smoked grey lacquer dial example is one of the most wearable executions, offered with its 2022 set.','{\"caliber\": \"AP 4302\", \"bracelet\": \"Grey alligator strap\", \"dialColor\": \"Smoked grey lacquer\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"41mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"White gold\", \"waterResistance\": \"30m\"}',9,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-AUD-15210BC.OO.A068CR.01','2026-10-11 01:30:33'),('ap-05','audemars-piguet-royal-oak-offshore-diver-15720stooa027ca01','audemars-piguet','Royal Oak Offshore Diver','15720ST.OO.A027CA.01',NULL,34500,2021,'Dive','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:01:39','The Royal Oak Offshore Diver (ref. 15720ST.OO.A027CA.01), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"AP 4308\",\"caseDiameter\":\"42mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Black M\\u00e9ga Tapisserie\",\"waterResistance\":\"300m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds, date, inner rotating bezel\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',8,NULL,0,'sports-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/audemars-piguet-royal-oak-offshore-diver-15720stooa027ca01\\/photo-1.jpg\"]','NV-AUD-15720ST.OO.A027CA.01','2026-10-11 02:01:39'),('ap-06','audemars-piguet-millenary-15350stood002cr01','audemars-piguet','Millenary','15350ST.OO.D002CR.01',NULL,21500,2018,'Dress','Stainless steel','Excellent','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:01:41','The Millenary (ref. 15350ST.OO.D002CR.01), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"AP 3120\",\"caseDiameter\":\"47 x 42mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Silver\",\"waterResistance\":\"20m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, small seconds\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',8,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/audemars-piguet-millenary-15350stood002cr01\\/photo-1.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/audemars-piguet-millenary-15350stood002cr01\\/photo-2.jpg\"]','NV-AUD-15350ST.OO.D002CR.01','2026-10-11 02:01:41'),('ap-07','audemars-piguet-royal-oak-chronograph-26240stoo1320st02','audemars-piguet','Royal Oak Chronograph','26240ST.OO.1320ST.02',NULL,52000,2022,'Chronograph','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 12:08:59','The Royal Oak Chronograph (ref. 26240ST.OO.1320ST.02), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"AP 4401\",\"caseDiameter\":\"41mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Blue Grande Tapisserie\",\"waterResistance\":\"50m\",\"functions\":\"Flyback chronograph, date\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',6,NULL,0,'luxury-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/audemars-piguet-royal-oak-chronograph-26240stoo1320st02\\/render-1.jpg\"]','NV-AUD-26240ST.OO.1320ST.02','2026-10-11 12:08:59'),('br-01','breitling-navitimer-b01-41-ab0139211l1a1','breitling','Navitimer B01 Chronograph 41','AB0139211L1A1',NULL,8400,2023,'Chronograph','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,78,'2025-08-03 00:00:00','The pilot\'s chronograph that started it all — circular slide rule, in-house B01 movement, and the emerald green dial of the 2022 redesign.\n\nNear-new 2023 example on the seven-row bracelet.','{\"caliber\": \"Breitling B01\", \"bracelet\": \"Steel seven-row bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Green\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, small seconds, date, chronograph, slide rule\", \"caseDiameter\": \"41mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"waterResistance\": \"30m\"}',8,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-BRE-AB0139211L1A1','2026-10-11 01:30:46'),('br-02','breitling-superocean-heritage-57','breitling','Superocean Heritage \'57','A10370121C1A1',NULL,4600,2021,'Dive','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,68,'2025-03-09 00:00:00','A faithful nod to the original 1957 Superocean — concave bezel, oversized indices and sea-blue dial in a slim 42mm case.\n\nExcellent 2021 example on the mesh Ocean Classic bracelet.','{\"caliber\": \"Breitling 10\", \"bracelet\": \"Steel mesh bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Blue\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds\", \"caseDiameter\": \"42mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"42 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',9,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-BRE-A10370121C1A1','2026-10-11 01:33:55'),('br-03','breitling-chronomat-b01-42','breitling','Chronomat B01 42','AB0134101K1A1',NULL,7150,2022,'Chronograph','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,70,'2025-06-05 00:00:00','The Chronomat\'s onion crown and rider tabs made it the watch of the eighties jet set; the current B01 generation keeps the swagger and adds a manufacture movement.\n\nAnthracite dial, Rouleaux bracelet, 2022 set.','{\"caliber\": \"Breitling B01\", \"bracelet\": \"Steel Rouleaux bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Anthracite\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, small seconds, date, chronograph\", \"caseDiameter\": \"42mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"waterResistance\": \"200m\"}',10,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-BRE-AB0134101K1A1','2025-06-05 00:00:00'),('br-04','breitling-premier-b09-pistachio','breitling','Premier B09 Chronograph 40','AB0930D31L1P1',NULL,7950,2024,'Dress','Stainless steel','New','Men',1,1,0,58,'2025-11-02 00:00:00','The Premier\'s pistachio-green dial is one of the great quiet flexes of modern watchmaking — a hand-wound 1940s-style chronograph for people who notice details.\n\nNew on brown alligator with the full 2024 warranty.','{\"caliber\": \"Breitling B09\", \"bracelet\": \"Brown alligator strap\", \"movement\": \"Manual winding\", \"dialColor\": \"Pistachio green\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, small seconds, chronograph\", \"caseDiameter\": \"40mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',7,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-BRE-AB0930D31L1P1','2025-11-02 00:00:00'),('br-05','breitling-avenger-chronograph-a13317101b1x1','breitling','Avenger Chronograph','A13317101B1X1',NULL,6200,2022,'Chronograph','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:01:48','The Avenger Chronograph (ref. A13317101B1X1), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"Breitling 13\",\"caseDiameter\":\"45mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Black\",\"waterResistance\":\"300m\",\"functions\":\"Chronograph, date\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',9,NULL,0,'sports-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/breitling-avenger-chronograph-a13317101b1x1\\/photo-1.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/breitling-avenger-chronograph-a13317101b1x1\\/photo-2.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/breitling-avenger-chronograph-a13317101b1x1\\/photo-3.jpg\"]','NV-BRE-A13317101B1X1','2026-10-11 02:01:48'),('br-06','breitling-emergency-e76325','breitling','Emergency','E76325',NULL,15500,2015,'Pilot','Titanium','Excellent','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:01:50','The Emergency (ref. E76325), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"Breitling 76\",\"caseDiameter\":\"51mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Orange\",\"waterResistance\":\"50m\",\"functions\":\"Dual-frequency distress beacon, multifunction\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Titanium\"}',10,NULL,0,'sports-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/breitling-emergency-e76325\\/photo-1.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/breitling-emergency-e76325\\/photo-2.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/breitling-emergency-e76325\\/photo-3.jpg\"]','NV-BRE-E76325','2026-10-11 02:01:50'),('br-07','breitling-colt-automatic-a17388','breitling','Colt Automatic','A17388',NULL,3400,2016,'Sport','Stainless steel','Excellent','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:01:53','The Colt Automatic (ref. A17388), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"Breitling 17\",\"caseDiameter\":\"44mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Blue\",\"waterResistance\":\"500m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',8,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/breitling-colt-automatic-a17388\\/photo-2.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/breitling-colt-automatic-a17388\\/photo-3.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/breitling-colt-automatic-a17388\\/photo-1.jpg\"]','NV-BRE-A17388','2026-10-11 02:01:53'),('ca-05','cartier-pasha-de-cartier-wspa0009','cartier','Pasha de Cartier','WSPA0009',NULL,7100,2022,'Sport','Stainless steel','Unworn','Unisex',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:01:44','The Pasha de Cartier (ref. WSPA0009), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"1847 MC\",\"caseDiameter\":\"41mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Silver\",\"waterResistance\":\"100m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',7,NULL,0,'luxury-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/cartier-pasha-de-cartier-wspa0009\\/photo-1.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/cartier-pasha-de-cartier-wspa0009\\/photo-2.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/cartier-pasha-de-cartier-wspa0009\\/photo-3.jpg\"]','NV-CAR-WSPA0009','2026-10-11 02:01:44'),('ca-06','cartier-santos-galbee-1564','cartier','Santos Galbée','1564',NULL,3900,1990,'Dress','Stainless steel and gold','Excellent','Unisex',0,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:07:21','The Santos Galbée (ref. 1564), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"Cartier 87\",\"caseDiameter\":\"29mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Ivory\",\"waterResistance\":\"30m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel and gold\"}',10,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/cartier-santos-galbee-1564\\/photo-1.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/cartier-santos-galbee-1564\\/photo-2.jpg\"]','NV-CAR-1564','2026-10-11 02:07:21'),('ca-07','cartier-santos-octagon-2966','cartier','Santos Octagon','2966',NULL,4600,1989,'Dress','Stainless steel and gold','Excellent','Men',0,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:07:22','The Santos Octagon (ref. 2966), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"Automatic\",\"caseDiameter\":\"30mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Ivory\",\"waterResistance\":\"30m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel and gold\"}',6,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/cartier-santos-octagon-2966\\/photo-1.jpg\"]','NV-CAR-2966','2026-10-11 02:07:22'),('ca-08','cartier-tank-solo-xl-3800','cartier','Tank Solo XL','3800',NULL,3600,2016,'Dress','Stainless steel','Excellent','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:07:23','The Tank Solo XL (ref. 3800), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"049\",\"caseDiameter\":\"31 x 40.85mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Silver\",\"waterResistance\":\"30m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',7,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/cartier-tank-solo-xl-3800\\/photo-1.jpg\"]','NV-CAR-3800','2026-10-11 02:07:23'),('ca-09','cartier-santos-100-medium-w20106x8','cartier','Santos 100 Medium','W20106X8',NULL,5600,2012,'Sport','Stainless steel','Excellent','Unisex',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:07:23','The Santos 100 Medium (ref. W20106X8), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"049\",\"caseDiameter\":\"33mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Silver\",\"waterResistance\":\"100m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',6,NULL,0,'luxury-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/cartier-santos-100-medium-w20106x8\\/photo-1.jpg\"]','NV-CAR-W20106X8','2026-10-11 02:07:23'),('ca-10','cartier-ballon-bleu-de-cartier-wsbb0040','cartier','Ballon Bleu de Cartier','WSBB0040',NULL,7350,2023,'Dress','Stainless steel','Unworn','Unisex',1,1,0,50,'2026-10-11 12:08:59','The Ballon Bleu de Cartier (ref. WSBB0040), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"1847 MC\",\"caseDiameter\":\"40mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Silver guilloch\\u00e9\",\"waterResistance\":\"30m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',9,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/cartier-ballon-bleu-de-cartier-wsbb0040\\/render-1.jpg\"]','NV-CAR-WSBB0040','2026-10-11 12:08:59'),('ca-11','cartier-roadster-w62025v3','cartier','Roadster','W62025V3',NULL,4900,2010,'Sport','Stainless steel','Excellent','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 12:08:59','The Roadster (ref. W62025V3), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"Cartier 3110\",\"caseDiameter\":\"37 x 43mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Silver\",\"waterResistance\":\"100m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',5,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/cartier-roadster-w62025v3\\/render-1.jpg\"]','NV-CAR-W62025V3','2026-10-11 12:08:59'),('car-01','cartier-santos-wssa0018','cartier','Santos de Cartier','WSSA0018',NULL,7250,2022,'Sport','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,1,85,'2025-07-07 00:00:00','Created in 1904 for aviator Alberto Santos-Dumont, the modern Santos keeps the square case and exposed screws while adding the QuickSwitch strap system and SmartLink sizing.\n\nA 2022 large model with both bracelet and leather strap included.','{\"caliber\": \"Cartier 1847 MC\", \"bracelet\": \"Steel bracelet + leather strap\", \"dialColor\": \"Silvered opaline\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"39.8mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"42 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',1,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-CAR-WSSA0018','2025-07-07 00:00:00'),('car-02','cartier-tank-must-wsta0041','cartier','Tank Must','WSTA0041',NULL,3100,2023,'Dress','Stainless steel','New','Women',1,1,0,81,'2025-10-12 00:00:00','The Tank has barely changed since 1917 because it never needed to. The large Tank Must distils the design to its essence — silvered dial, blued sword hands, beaded crown with blue cabochon.\n\nBrand new on black grained calfskin with the full Cartier set.','{\"caliber\": \"Cartier quartz\", \"bracelet\": \"Black grained calfskin\", \"movement\": \"Quartz\", \"dialColor\": \"Silvered\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes\", \"caseDiameter\": \"33.7 \\u00d7 25.5mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"\\u2014\", \"waterResistance\": \"30m\"}',1,NULL,0,'womens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-CAR-WSTA0041','2025-10-12 00:00:00'),('car-03','cartier-panthere-wgpn0007','cartier','Panthère de Cartier','WGPN0007',NULL,21900,2021,'Dress','Yellow gold','Unworn','Women',1,0,0,76,'2025-04-29 00:00:00','Supple as jewellery, unmistakable as a Tank\'s cousin — the Panthère in 18k yellow gold moves like liquid on the wrist.\n\nA small-model example from 2021, fully serviced and presented with its Cartier pouch and papers.','{\"caliber\": \"Cartier quartz\", \"bracelet\": \"Gold link bracelet\", \"movement\": \"Quartz\", \"dialColor\": \"Silvered\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes\", \"caseDiameter\": \"22mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"18k yellow gold\", \"powerReserve\": \"\\u2014\", \"waterResistance\": \"30m\"}',8,NULL,0,'womens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-CAR-WGPN0007','2025-04-29 00:00:00'),('car-04','cartier-santos-dumont-vintage-1575','cartier','Santos-Dumont','1575',NULL,9800,1998,'Dress','Yellow gold','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,66,'2025-01-30 00:00:00','An ultra-thin yellow gold Santos-Dumont from the late nineties — the dressiest expression of the aviation original, barely 5mm at the case.\n\nCrisp guilloché dial, correct cabochon crown, and a fresh Cartier service.','{\"caliber\": \"Cartier 06 (manual)\", \"bracelet\": \"Bordeaux alligator strap\", \"movement\": \"Manual winding\", \"dialColor\": \"Silvered guilloch\\u00e9\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes\", \"caseDiameter\": \"27 \\u00d7 36mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"18k yellow gold\", \"powerReserve\": \"40 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"30m\"}',9,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-CAR-1575','2025-01-30 00:00:00'),('gs-01','grand-seiko-snowflake-sbga211','grand-seiko','Heritage \"Snowflake\"','SBGA211',NULL,5600,2022,'Dress','Titanium','Unworn','Men',1,0,1,84,'2025-08-11 00:00:00','The watch that made the world take Grand Seiko seriously — a white dial textured like wind-blown snow over the Spring Drive\'s perfectly smooth glide seconds.\n\nHigh-intensity titanium, 2022, complete set.','{\"caliber\": \"Grand Seiko 9R65 Spring Drive\", \"bracelet\": \"Titanium bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Snow white\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date, power reserve\", \"caseDiameter\": \"41mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"High-intensity titanium\", \"powerReserve\": \"72 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',1,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-GRA-SBGA211','2025-08-11 00:00:00'),('gs-02','grand-seiko-sbgh269-japanese-maple','grand-seiko','Heritage Hi-Beat \"Autumn\"','SBGH269',NULL,6900,2019,'Dress','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,62,'2025-05-22 00:00:00','A limited Hi-Beat with a dial the colour of turning maple leaves — Grand Seiko\'s texture work at its most poetic.\n\n2019 limited edition, full set, superb condition.','{\"caliber\": \"Grand Seiko 9S85 Hi-Beat\", \"bracelet\": \"Steel bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Crimson maple\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"39.5mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"55 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',5,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-GRA-SBGH269','2025-05-22 00:00:00'),('gs-03','grand-seiko-sbgm221-gmt','grand-seiko','Elegance GMT','SBGM221',NULL,4650,2021,'GMT','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,57,'2025-03-03 00:00:00','A 39.5mm ivory-dial GMT with a box sapphire crystal and the most elegant blue GMT hand in the business — vintage proportions, modern movement.\n\nOn brown crocodile, 2021, excellent.','{\"caliber\": \"Grand Seiko 9S66\", \"bracelet\": \"Brown crocodile strap\", \"dialColor\": \"Ivory\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date, GMT\", \"caseDiameter\": \"39.5mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"72 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"30m\"}',5,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-GRA-SBGM221','2025-03-03 00:00:00'),('gs-04','grand-seiko-sbga415-taisetsu','grand-seiko','Heritage \"Taisetsu\" Seasons','SBGA415',NULL,6150,2023,'Dress','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,1,0,66,'2025-10-21 00:00:00','The Taisetsu — \"deep snow\" — dial renders a winter forest in layered greys, paired with Spring Drive\'s signature sweep.\n\nUnworn 2023 boutique edition with complete set.','{\"caliber\": \"Grand Seiko 9R65 Spring Drive\", \"bracelet\": \"Steel bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Silver-grey textured\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date, power reserve\", \"caseDiameter\": \"40mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"72 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',10,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-GRA-SBGA415','2025-10-21 00:00:00'),('gs-05','grand-seiko-heritage-automatic-sbgr051','grand-seiko','Heritage Automatic','SBGR051',NULL,4700,2016,'Dress','Stainless steel','Excellent','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:07:17','The Heritage Automatic (ref. SBGR051)