le on Caoutchouc rubber, serviced.','{\"caliber\": \"Panerai P.900\", \"bracelet\": \"Blue Caoutchouc rubber\", \"dialColor\": \"Blue ceramic\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, small seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"42mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"AISI 316L steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"72 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"300m\"}',8,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-PAN-PAM00959','2025-03-15 00:00:00'),('pan-04','panerai-radiomir-vintage-pam00380','panerai','Radiomir Black Seal Logo','PAM00380',NULL,4900,2012,'Dive','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,54,'2025-01-12 00:00:00','The wire-lugged Radiomir in its purest form — hand-wound, no seconds, the double-torch OP logo at six. A purist\'s Panerai.\n\n2012 example, fully serviced with two-year warranty.','{\"caliber\": \"Panerai OP II\", \"bracelet\": \"Black calf strap\", \"movement\": \"Manual winding\", \"dialColor\": \"Black sandwich\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes\", \"caseDiameter\": \"45mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Polished steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"56 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',6,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-PAN-PAM00380','2025-01-12 00:00:00'),('pan-05','panerai-luminor-marina-pam00111','panerai','Luminor Marina','PAM00111',NULL,5400,2014,'Sport','Stainless steel','Excellent','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:07:25','The Luminor Marina (ref. PAM00111), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"OP XI\",\"caseDiameter\":\"44mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Black\",\"waterResistance\":\"300m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, small seconds\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',7,NULL,0,'sports-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/panerai-luminor-marina-pam00111\\/photo-1.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/panerai-luminor-marina-pam00111\\/photo-2.jpg\",\"\\/images\\/watches\\/panerai-luminor-marina-pam00111\\/photo-3.jpg\"]','NV-PAN-PAM00111','2026-10-11 02:07:25'),('pan-06','panerai-luminor-gmt-pam01535','panerai','Luminor GMT','PAM01535',NULL,9