sented in unworn condition with full box and papers, the watch retains its factory bracelet sizing and protective bezel film.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 3235\", \"bracelet\": \"Oyster bracelet, Oystersteel\", \"dialColor\": \"Black\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"41mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Oystersteel\", \"waterResistance\": \"300m\"}',1,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,1,NULL,'NV-ROL-126610LN','2026-10-11 01:19:09'),('rlx-02','rolex-gmt-master-ii-pepsi-126710blro','rolex','GMT-Master II \"Pepsi\"','126710BLRO','Pepsi',21900,2022,'GMT','Oystersteel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,94,'2025-08-14 00:00:00','The blue-and-red Cerachrom GMT-Master II on the Jubilee bracelet — the configuration collectors chased from its 2018 return. The calibre 3285 tracks a second time zone with an independently adjustable hour hand.\n\nPresented in unworn condition with crisp case lines, complete set dated 2022.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 3285\", \"bracelet\": \"Jubilee bracelet, Oystersteel\", \"dialColor\": \"Black\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date, second time zone\", \"caseDiameter\": \"40mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Oystersteel\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',1,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,1,NULL,'NV-ROL-126710BLRO','2026-10-11 01:30:12'),('rlx-03','rolex-datejust-31-two-tone-278273','rolex','Datejust 31','278273',NULL,13400,2024,'Dress','Yellow gold & Oystersteel','New','Women',1,1,0,78,'2025-11-01 00:00:00','The ladies\' Datejust in its most classic form: fluted yellow gold bezel, champagne dial and the supple Jubilee bracelet. At 31mm it wears with true jewellery presence without sacrificing everyday robustness.\n\nOffered new and unsized, with the full 2024 Rolex warranty card set.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 2236\", \"bracelet\": \"Jubilee bracelet, two-tone\", \"dialColor\": \"Champagne\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"31mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Yellow gold & Oystersteel\", \"powerReserve\": \"55 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',8,NULL,0,'womens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-ROL-278273','2025-11-01 00:00:00'),('rlx-04','rolex-daytona-16520-vintage','rolex','Cosmograph Daytona','16520 \"Zenith\"',NULL,38500,1997,'Chronograph','Oystersteel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,88,'2025-06-20 00:00:00','The \"Zenith\" Daytona — powered by the heavily reworked El Primero calibre 4030 — is the bridge between vintage charm and the modern in-house era. This 1997 example bears the coveted inverted-6 dial configuration.\n\nUnpolished case edges, original tritium-lume plots aged to a warm ivory, and its punched guarantee papers.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 4030\", \"bracelet\": \"Oyster bracelet, Oystersteel\", \"dialColor\": \"White\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, small seconds, chronograph\", \"caseDiameter\": \"40mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Oystersteel\", \"powerReserve\": \"54 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',1,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,1,NULL,'NV-ROL-16520\"ZENITH\"','2025-06-20 00:00:00'),('rlx-05','rolex-submariner-kermit-16610lv','rolex','Submariner Date \"Kermit\"','16610LV','Kermit',16800,2004,'Dive','Oystersteel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,90,'2025-09-27 00:00:00','The 50th-anniversary Submariner — green aluminium bezel over a maxi dial — earned its Kermit nickname instantly and its classic status since.\n\nA 2004 example with a richly faded insert, solid case and full set.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 3135\", \"bracelet\": \"Oyster bracelet, Oystersteel\", \"dialColor\": \"Black\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"40mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Oystersteel\", \"powerReserve\": \"48 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"300m\"}',1,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,1,NULL,'NV-ROL-16610LV','2025-09-27 00:00:00'),('rlx-06','rolex-submariner-5513-vintage','rolex','Submariner','5513',NULL,19500,1972,'Dive','Oystersteel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,85,'2025-03-30 00:00:00','The reference 5513 carried the Submariner through three decades — this 1972 example wears a gorgeous matte dial with