ex-datejust-36-126234','rolex','Datejust 36','126234',NULL,10200,2023,'Dress','White gold & Oystersteel','Unworn','Unisex',1,1,0,91,'2025-10-15 00:00:00','The Datejust at its most correct: 36mm, fluted white-gold bezel, Jubilee bracelet and the slate Wimbledon dial with green-outlined Romans.\n\n2023 example in near-new condition with the full set.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 3235\", \"bracelet\": \"Jubilee bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Slate\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"36mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"White gold & Oystersteel\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',1,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,1,NULL,'NV-ROL-126234','2025-10-15 00:00:00'),('rlx-10','rolex-datejust-36-16233-vintage','rolex','Datejust 36','16233',NULL,7850,1993,'Dress','Yellow gold & Oystersteel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,73,'2025-04-17 00:00:00','The quintessential nineties Datejust — champagne tapestry dial, fluted yellow-gold bezel, and a tight Jubilee bracelet in two-tone.\n\n1993 example, freshly serviced, with its original punched papers.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 3135\", \"bracelet\": \"Jubilee bracelet, two-tone\", \"dialColor\": \"Champagne tapestry\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"36mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Yellow gold & Oystersteel\", \"powerReserve\": \"48 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',8,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-ROL-16233','2025-04-17 00:00:00'),('rlx-11','rolex-datejust-41-126300','rolex','Datejust 41','126300',NULL,8900,2021,'Dress','Oystersteel','Unworn','Unisex',1,0,0,76,'2025-05-09 00:00:00','The smooth-bezel Datejust 41 is the quiet daily wearer of the line — mint-green dial, oyster bracelet, calibre 3235.\n\n2021 example with box, papers and very light wear.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 3235\", \"bracelet\": \"Oyster bracelet, Oystersteel\", \"dialColor\": \"Mint green\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"41mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Oystersteel\", \"waterResistance\": 