\": \"Hours, minutes, small seconds, chronograph\", \"caseDiameter\": \"40mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Yellow gold & Oystersteel\", \"powerReserve\": \"72 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',1,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-ROL-116503','2025-06-26 00:00:00'),('rlx-15','rolex-day-date-40-228238','rolex','Day-Date 40','228238',NULL,44500,2023,'Dress','Yellow gold','Unworn','Men',1,0,1,89,'2025-10-23 00:00:00','The President in solid yellow gold — fluted bezel, champagne dial, the day spelled in full at twelve and the heft only a gold Rolex delivers.\n\nUnworn 2023 set on the concealed-clasp President bracelet.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 3255\", \"bracelet\": \"President bracelet, yellow gold\", \"dialColor\": \"Champagne\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, day, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"40mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"18k yellow gold\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',1,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,1,NULL,'NV-ROL-228238','2025-10-23 00:00:00'),('rlx-16','rolex-day-date-36-128235','rolex','Day-Date 36','128235',NULL,37500,2022,'Dress','Rose gold','Unworn','Unisex',1,0,0,74,'2025-07-11 00:00:00','Everose gold and a chocolate dial — the warmest, most discreet Day-Date of the modern line.\n\n2022 example on President bracelet, full set.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 3255\", \"bracelet\": \"President bracelet, Everose\", \"dialColor\": \"Chocolate\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, day, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"36mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"18k Everose gold\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m\"}',8,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-ROL-128235','2025-07-11 00:00:00'),('rlx-17','rolex-explorer-36-124270','rolex','Explorer 36','124270',NULL,7900,2024,'Sport','Oystersteel','Unworn','Men',1,1,0,86,'2025-11-06 00:00:00','Back to the original 36mm — the Explorer is the purest sports watch Rolex makes: 3-6-9 numerals, no date, nothing to hide behind.\n\nUnworn 2024 full set.','{\"caliber\": \"Rolex 3230\", \"bracelet\": \"Oyster bracelet, Oystersteel\", \"dialColor\": \"Bl