2024,'Dive','Titanium','New','Men',1,1,0,74,'2025-10-30 00:00:00','The Pelagos distilled to its perfect size: 39mm of grade-2 titanium, fully matte, with the effortless legibility that made the line a professional favourite.\n\nBrand new 2024 set on bracelet plus rubber strap.','{\"caliber\": \"Tudor MT5400\", \"bracelet\": \"Titanium bracelet + rubber strap\", \"dialColor\": \"Black matte\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds\", \"caseDiameter\": \"39mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Grade 2 titanium\", \"waterResistance\": \"200m\"}',8,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-TUD-25407N-0001','2025-10-30 00:00:00'),('tud-04','tudor-prince-oysterdate-vintage-74034','tudor','Prince Oysterdate','74034',NULL,2950,1995,'Dress','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,49,'2025-01-22 00:00:00','A mid-nineties Prince Oysterdate — Rolex-built case, self-winding ETA heart, and the quiet charm of a watch that simply does everything right.\n\nOriginal silver dial, service crown and a fresh overhaul; a charming entry into vintage Tudor.','{\"caliber\": \"ETA 2824-2\", \"bracelet\": \"Steel Oyster-style bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Silver\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"34mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"38 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"100m (as rated)\"}',10,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-TUD-74034','2025-01-22 00:00:00'),('tud-05','tudor-heritage-ranger-79910','tudor','Heritage Ranger','79910',NULL,2900,2016,'Sport','Stainless steel','Excellent','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:02:03','The Heritage Ranger (ref. 79910), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"ETA 2824\",\"caseDiameter\":\"41mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Black\",\"waterResistance\":\"150m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',10,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/tudor-heritage-ranger-79910\\/photo-1.jpg\"]','NV-TUD-79910','2026-10-11 02:02:03'),('tud-06','tudor-submariner-7928','tudor','Submariner','7928',NULL,9800,1964,'Dive','Stainless steel','Excellent','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:02:05','A vintage Tudor Submariner (ref. 7928) with a black gilt dial and crown guards, inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"Tudor 390\",\"caseDiameter\":\"40mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Black gilt\",\"waterResistance\":\"200m (as rated)\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\",\"bracelet\":\"Riveted Oyster bracelet\"}',7,NULL,0,'sports-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/tudor-submariner-7928\\/photo-1.jpg\"]','NV-TUD-7928','2026-10-11 02:05:37'),('tud-07','tudor-submariner-snowflake-94110','tudor','Submariner Snowflake','9411/0',NULL,9800,1978,'Dive','Stainless steel','Excellent','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 12:08:59','The Submariner Snowflake (ref. 9411/0), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"ETA 2784\",\"caseDiameter\":\"40mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Blue\",\"waterResistance\":\"200m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',9,NULL,0,'sports-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/tudor-submariner-snowflake-94110\\/render-1.jpg\"]','NV-TUD-9411/0','2026-10-11 12:08:59'),('vc-01','vacheron-constantin-overseas-4500v','vacheron-constantin','Overseas Self-Winding','4500V/110A-B128',NULL,24500,2021,'Sport','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,1,87,'2025-10-05 00:00:00','The Overseas blue dial is the thinking collector\'s luxury sports watch — Geneva-seal finishing, Maltese-cross bezel, and three quick-release strap options.\n\n2021 example with bracelet, rubber and leather straps, all included.','{\"caliber\": \"VC 5100\", \"bracelet\": \"Steel bracelet + 2 straps\", \"dialColor\": \"Blue lacquer\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"41mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"60 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"150m\"}',1,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,1,NULL,'NV-VAC-4500V/110A-B128','2025-10-05 00:00:00'),('vc-02','vacheron-constantin-patrimony-85180','vacheron-constantin','Patrimony Self-Winding','85180/000R-9248',NULL,25900,2020,'Dress','Rose gold','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,71,'2025-04-14 00:00:00','The Patrimony\'s convex dial and slender rose-gold case distil Genevan classicism into its purest modern form — a perpetual reference among dress watches.\n\nComplete 2020 set; unworn since a full manufacture service.','{\"caliber\": \"VC 2450 Q6\", \"bracelet\": \"Brown alligator strap\", \"dialColor\": \"Silvered opaline\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"40mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"18k rose gold\", \"powerReserve\": \"40 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"30m\"}',8,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-VAC-85180/000R-9248','2025-04-14 00:00:00'),('vc-03','vacheron-constantin-fiftysix-4600e','vacheron-constantin','Fiftysix Self-Winding','4600E/000A-B487',NULL,13500,2022,'Dress','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,69,'2025-07-26 00:00:00','The Fiftysix channels a 1956 Vacheron reference — box crystal, sector dial, Arabic-and-baton alternation — into the maison\'s most accessible line.\n\nSepia-toned dial, 2022, near new.','{\"caliber\": \"VC 1326\", \"bracelet\": \"Brown calf strap\", \"dialColor\": \"Sepia brown sector\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, seconds, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"40mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"Stainless steel\", \"powerReserve\": \"48 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"30m\"}',8,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-VAC-4600E/000A-B487','2025-07-26 00:00:00'),('vc-04','vacheron-constantin-historiques-222','vacheron-constantin','Historiques 222','4200H/222J-B935',NULL,78500,2024,'Sport','Yellow gold','Unworn','Men',1,1,0,86,'2025-11-08 00:00:00','Vacheron\'s faithful revival of its 1977 integrated-bracelet 222 — the maison\'s answer to the Genta era, in solid yellow gold with the tonneau-link bracelet.\n\nUnworn 2024 example; a modern classic already trading above retail.','{\"caliber\": \"VC 2455/2\", \"bracelet\": \"Integrated gold bracelet\", \"dialColor\": \"Champagne gold\", \"functions\": \"Hours, minutes, date\", \"caseDiameter\": \"37mm\", \"caseMaterial\": \"18k yellow gold\", \"powerReserve\": \"40 hours\", \"waterResistance\": \"50m\"}',8,NULL,0,'mens-watches',1,2,NULL,'NV-VAC-4200H/222J-B935','2025-11-08 00:00:00'),('vc-05','vacheron-constantin-patrimony-81180000g-9117','vacheron-constantin','Patrimony','81180/000G-9117',NULL,23500,2021,'Dress','18k yellow gold','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:02:29','The Patrimony (ref. 81180/000G-9117), inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"1400\",\"caseDiameter\":\"40mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Silver opaline\",\"waterResistance\":\"30m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes\",\"caseMaterial\":\"18k yellow gold\"}',5,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/vacheron-constantin-patrimony-81180000g-9117\\/photo-1.jpg\"]','NV-VAC-81180/000G-9117','2026-10-11 02:02:29'),('vc-06','vacheron-constantin-fiftysix-complete-calendar-4000e000a-b439','vacheron-constantin','Fiftysix Complete Calendar','4000E/000A-B439',NULL,21500,2022,'Dress','Stainless steel','Unworn','Men',1,0,0,50,'2026-10-11 02:02:33','The Fiftysix Complete Calendar (ref. 4000E/000A-B439) with day, date, month and moon phase, inspected, timed and certified by our horologists before shipping fully insured.','{\"caliber\":\"2460 QCL\\/1\",\"caseDiameter\":\"40mm\",\"dialColor\":\"Silver\",\"waterResistance\":\"30m\",\"functions\":\"Hours, minutes, seconds, day, date, month, moon phase\",\"caseMaterial\":\"Stainless steel\"}',9,NULL,0,'dress-watches',1,1,'[\"\\/images\\/watches\\/vacheron-constantin-fiftysix-complete-calendar-4000e000a-b439\\/photo-1.jpg\"]','NV-VAC-4000E/000A-B439','2026-10-11 02:05:37'),('vc-07','vacheron-constantin-traditionnelle-82172000r-9382','vacheron-const